{"reviews":[{"id":"B074T41RSG-0","r":1.0,"t":"Watered down","x":"I buy this product at the local beauty supply store all the time and decided ti order it online never again! The product is so watered down and does not smell like the original product very disappointed.....","h":24,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2018"},{"id":"B074T41RSG-1","r":5.0,"t":"Best thing since slice bread","x":"Bought this July 2018 and this is my growth This product is THE BEST . GREAT RESULTS I\u2019m telling you","h":19,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B074T41RSG-2","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"you have to use it everyday or every other day in order to see results","h":18,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2018"},{"id":"B074T41RSG-3","r":5.0,"t":"LOVE IT AND IT WORKS!","x":"I ORDERED THIS OIL TWICE FOR MY DAUGHTER AND IT DOES WORK VERY WELL. KEEPS THE HAIR MOISTURIZED AND IT WILL GROW.","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B074T41RSG-4","r":4.0,"t":"I like it!","x":"I had a bald spot near the edge if my hair line and now it has hair growing in it !","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B074T41RSG-5","r":5.0,"t":"Works great","x":"This made my edges come back in like a month . I lost all my edges.this is like magic works wonders.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B074T41RSG-6","r":2.0,"t":"My Truth","x":"I purchased this product and I was excited to use it after reading all the positive reviews. However, after using this product for over a month I'm disappointed. The pros are: it did thicken my thin hair. It does keep your hair oily allowing easy comb through. Unfortunately, the cons are it did not grow my hair instead it broke it off. I also tried it on my eyebrows and nothing happened no change in appearance. I'm on the fence about giving it more time. I would not recommend this product.","h":3,"v":0,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B074T41RSG-7","r":3.0,"t":"#TeamWildGrow","x":"I was nervous ordering online but have purchased in store they came sealed just like in a retail store and were full size regular looking bottles I like the smell it makes my scalp want more may switch to online only no complaints at all about quality, quantity, or new growth was mad crazy .. would by again but the price inflated so sad i would have definitely ordered again.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B074T41RSG-8","r":5.0,"t":"Met all the expectations","x":"I used this on my scalp and hair. After a month I noticed growth and volume. After I had started using this product a friend who was braiding my hair commented on the difference she felt in texture and volume. I would recommend this product. Be patient and you will experience great results!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B074T41RSG-9","r":5.0,"t":"my hair has grown noticeably thicker and long","x":"many complements since i started using it.consistency is key.be patient dont apply for one week and think you will get a difference.this is my 6th month and am happy with the progress.thicker stronger hair","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B074T41RSG-10","r":5.0,"t":"It really works!","x":"I love this product! My hair grew unbelievably and the coconut oil helped relieve the dandruff problem.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2018"},{"id":"B074T41RSG-11","r":5.0,"t":"It made my hair grow and it's still growing.","x":"This product works! I have long hair now. I started to see growth in 2 months. Highly recommend.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2019"},{"id":"B074T41RSG-12","r":5.0,"t":"It\u2019s worth the money","x":"When the first day by the third day you see results","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B074T41RSG-13","r":5.0,"t":"Great Product","x":"I\u2019ve been using this product for quite some time and it\u2019s great for you hair. My hair type is about 4B-4C and this oil mixes great with my hair. It\u2019s not too thick to where it\u2019s well...coating your scale but it evenly spreads over your scale after being applied. I think this is great and getting this amount is a better deal than just buying one.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B074T41RSG-14","r":5.0,"t":"Helps my hair","x":"I like this hair oil,I use it on my hair all the time.I use to be able to buy it at Sallys beauty salon here in town but now I have to order it.It calms my static hair and makes it easier to comb and brush.Thank you very much Sincerely June","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B074T41RSG-15","r":2.0,"t":"Hair grow oil","x":"I used it for two years and did not have any growth... so I stopped and started using something else.  You can try it, but you can always stop if you don't get the results you want with any product.  I'm in control of my beauty tips.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B074T41RSG-16","r":2.0,"t":"Not good for straight hair","x":"I have straight hair and when I used it my hair was exaggerated of oil for days even after I would shower. I don\u2019t recommend it if you have straight hair.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B074T41RSG-17","r":5.0,"t":"My hair has grown like wild fire","x":"I love this stuff.... Notice right after my chemo treatment, and also had my daughter .who has had a hard time growning her hair even notice a change .","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B074T41RSG-18","r":1.0,"t":"Honesty!!","x":"Ingredients on bottle does not match what is on the description on amazon. Very annoying and disappointing!!stop giving off false information.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B074T41RSG-19","r":5.0,"t":"I love it.","x":"This oil is one of the best i have used. It really does grow your hair. Along with drinking, H20 and taking multivitamins it works fine.","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B074T41RSG-20","r":5.0,"t":"i love it","x":"i love it so much i had been blessed to buy more. ...great moisture, keep hair strong and healthy as well as scalp.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B074T41RSG-21","r":4.0,"t":"Does it work","x":"For hair growth. I didn\u2019t see as much growth as i want but i do feel it help thicken my hair.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B074T41RSG-22","r":4.0,"t":"Four Stars","x":"Loving how it makes my hair grow. Going to continue to use this in my regular hair regimen.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2018"},{"id":"B074T41RSG-23","r":5.0,"t":"If I stop the wild growth hair will my hair fall out","x":"if I stop the wild growth treatment will my hair fall out and how ofren do I wash it","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B074T41RSG-24","r":5.0,"t":"One of the best hair oils on the market","x":"I have used this product for about 5 years and it is great for growing hair.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Most reviewers report that the product promotes hair growth, with many citing new growth, thicker hair, or restored edges.","cites":[2,4,5,6,9,10,11,12]},{"text":"Several reviewers note that consistent, patient use over weeks or months is required to see results.","cites":[3,9,10,12]},{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise the product for keeping hair moisturized, softer, and easier to comb or brush.","cites":[4,7,14,15]},{"text":"A few reviewers complain that the online product seemed watered down or different from the store version, or that it disappointed after extended use.","cites":[1,7]},{"text":"Some reviewers mention the product's pleasant smell or its effectiveness on scalp issues like dandruff and static.","cites":[8,11,15]}]},"qa":[]}